+# ALKEVA — System Design & Architecture
+
+| | |
+|---|---|
+| **Version** | 1.0 |
+| **Date** | 6 August 2026 |
+| **Status** | Final for the 13 Aug demo build |
+| **Inputs** | `ALKEVA_Spec_v1.0.md` (scope) · `Technical_FactCheck.md` (verified claims) · Decision Log in `CLAUDE.md` (6 Aug decisions) |
+
+Every element here was re-derived from the spec and the fact-check — where this document disagrees with `Convo_With_Claude.ai.md`, this document wins, and the fact-check explains why.
