+---
+
+## 1. System overview
+
+ALKEVA is a **principal dealer**: users buy metal *from* the platform and sell *back to* the platform at quoted prices. There is no order book, no user-to-user matching, no user-to-user transfers (Q33). The platform's word is only as good as its ledger — which is why the ledger, not the UI, is the center of this design.
+
+```
+┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│  Next.js mobile web app        Amharic-first · Trust-Wallet  │
+│  (user app + admin console)    style · passkey biometrics    │
+└──────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┘
+                       │ HTTPS/JSON · JWT
+┌──────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────┐
+│  NestJS API  (one deployable, modular)                       │
+│                                                              │
+│  ┌─────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ ┌────────────┐ ┌────────────┐  │
+│  │ Identity │ │ TRADING CORE │ │ COMPLIANCE │ │ AI (Gemini │  │
+│  │ + KYC    │ │ quote·order  │ │ rules eng. │ │ JS SDK)    │  │
+│  │ tiers    │ │ ledger·fees  │ │ freeze     │ │ READ-ONLY  │  │
+│  └─────────┘ └──────────────┘ └────────────┘ └────────────┘  │
+│  ┌─────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ ┌────────────┐ ┌────────────┐  │
+│  │ Treasury │ │ Payments     │ │ Admin      │ │ Audit log  │  │
+│  │ float·   │ │ (Chapa)      │ │ (RBAC)     │ │ append-    │  │
+│  │ reserve  │ │ webhooks     │ │            │ │ only       │  │
+│  └─────────┘ └──────────────┘ └────────────┘ └────────────┘  │
+└───────┬───────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┘
+        │               │
+┌───────▼──────┐  ┌─────▼─────────────────────────────────────┐
+│ Price worker │  │ External: Chapa (sandbox) · Gemini API ·  │
+│ 30s tick     │  │ gold-api.com / Swissquote · open.er-api   │
+└───────┬──────┘  └───────────────────────────────────────────┘
+        │
+┌───────▼──────────────┐   ┌─────────────────┐
+│ Postgres (Supabase)  │   │ Redis (Render)  │
+│ single source of     │   │ idempotency ·   │
+│ truth for all money  │   │ rate limiting   │
+└──────────────────────┘   └─────────────────┘
+```
+
+**Three deployables on Render** (all from one monorepo): `web` (Next.js), `api` (NestJS), `worker` (price tick — a small Node process sharing the api's db layer). Postgres on Supabase, Redis on Render. No Python (fact-check §3.1).
+
+### The five non-negotiables (design invariants)
+
+1. **AI never writes** — its only capabilities are three read-only tools (§8).
+2. **Balances are never edited** — `ledger_entry` is append-only; balance = SUM projection.
+3. **Quotes expire** — orders execute a stored quote's integers, never a live price.
+4. **No solo money movement** — privileged actions audit-logged; approvals separated where staffing allows.
+5. **Reserve gate inside the buy transaction** — `SUM(user grams) ≤ vault grams` checked under the same locks that post the entries. No override.
+
