+## 2. Monorepo layout
+
+```
+alkeva/
+├── apps/
+│   ├── web/          # Next.js — user app + /admin routes
+│   ├── api/          # NestJS — all modules below
+│   └── worker/       # price-tick loop (imports from packages/db)
+├── packages/
+│   ├── db/           # schema + migrations + typed queries (shared)
+│   └── shared/       # DTOs, config schema, i18n keys
+├── docs/
+└── CLAUDE.md
+```
+
+NestJS modules: `auth`, `kyc`, `prices`, `quotes`, `orders`, `ledger`, `fees`, `treasury`, `payments`, `payouts`, `compliance`, `ai`, `admin`, `audit`, `notifications`, `badges`, `delivery`.
+
